{
  "id": 8834818310343,
  "title": "Personalized Deer Couple Inside Heart Frame Comforter with Buck",
  "handle": "personalized-deer-couple-inside-heart-frame-comforter-with-buck-272c047bd6-272c047bd6",
  "body_html": "<p>Add a warm, rustic touch to your home with the custom bedding collection from Jeminise. This personalized hunting-themed quilt set is designed to bring cozy comfort and a touch of the wild indoors. Perfect for couples, families, and outdoor enthusiasts, it serves as a meaningful gift for anniversaries, birthdays, holidays, or special occasions.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Features customizable text squares, background, and framing colors to create a truly unique and meaningful piece.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Cozy Feel:</strong> Made from a soft, breathable blend of 70% cotton and 30% polyester with high-quality silk floss filling for year-round warmth.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Offered in five convenient sizes including Throw (60x70 inches), Twin (70x80 inches), Queen (80x90 inches), and King (91x102 inches).</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Perfect for indoor and outdoor activities, including bed bedding, sofa lounging, backyard relaxing, camping, and picnics.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water; dries quickly and fluffs up beautifully after washing.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> Set includes one custom quilt with optional matching pillowcases (available in quantities of 2 or 4).</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>70% Cotton, 30% Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fill Material</th>\n<td>Silk Floss</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Deer Couple-08</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Animal Print</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Deer Couple Hunting</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Hunting, Wildlife</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>1 text input</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
